const body = "<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-vhfty4fb alignfull uagb-is-root-container\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ojjorknc\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-csp9zuol\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-vuqrqajl uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h1 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Thank You! Your Blue Staffy Puppies Journey Just Began!</strong></h1></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">We’ve successfully received your inquiry and are thrilled you’re interested in our Staffy family. While we prepare our personalized response, explore our resources to learn more about bringing home your perfect pup.</p><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Home Page</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What’s Next in Your Blue Staffy Puppies Journey? Your Message is on its Way to Us!</h2>\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to BlueStaffyUK! We’ve successfully received your message and are thrilled you’re interested in our <strong>Blue Staffy</strong> family.</p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What Happens Next?</h3>\n<p>We know you’re excited, and so are we! Our dedicated team aims to personally review and respond to all inquiries within <strong>24-48 business hours</strong>. Please keep an eye on your email inbox (and don’t forget to check your spam or junk folder, just in case!) for our reply.</p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">While You Wait, Explore More of the BlueStaffyUK World!</h3>\n<p>We have plenty to share to help you prepare for and understand our amazing Staffies. Dive into our resources designed to support you every step of the way:</p>\n<p><strong>Discover Our Adorable Puppies:</strong> See who’s currently ready to find their forever home. Head over to our dedicated page to <strong><a href=\"/buy-blue-staffy-puppies-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">buy Staffy puppies in the UK</a></strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Learn About the Breed:</strong> Get comprehensive insights into the <strong><a href=\"/uk-staffordshire-bull-terrier-guide/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Staffy breed guide</a></strong> and understand their wonderful temperament and needs.</p>\n<p><strong>Our Commitment to Health:</strong> Explore our rigorous health protocols and learn more about the <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-health-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">health and care of Blue Staffies</a></strong> that make our puppies thrive.</p>\n<p><strong>Meet Our Breeding Dogs:</strong> Get to know the parents of our litters and learn about our ethical breeding practices by visiting our <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-breeding-dogs-glasgow/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Staffy breeding parents in the Glasgow</a></strong> section.</p>\n<p><strong>Connect Locally:</strong> If you’re interested in finding a specific Staffy puppy near you, browse our <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/blue-staffy-puppies-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">UK Blue Staffy Puppy Locations</a></strong> for more details.</p>\n<p><strong>Hear From Happy Families:</strong> Read testimonials from our cherished puppy owners and see the joy our Staffies bring to homes.</p>\n<p><strong>Owner Resources:</strong> Dive deeper into Staffy ownership tips and advice with our helpful <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-blog-guides/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Blue Staffy blog guides</a></strong> for new owners.</p>\n<p>External <strong>Resources:</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.thekennelclub.org.uk/dog-breeding/dog-breeding-regulations/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Responsible Breeding Guidelines from The Kennel Club</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/bring-pet-to-great-britain\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Official UK Pet Travel Scheme Information</a></p>\n<p>At BlueStaffyUK, we are dedicated to raising healthy, happy, and well-socialised <strong>Blue Staffy puppies</strong> that become cherished members of families across the UK. To learn more about how we handle your information with the utmost care, please review our <strong><a href=\"/privacy-policy-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Policy UK</a></strong>. If you need to follow up directly, you can always <strong><a href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">contact our purebred Blue Staffy breeders</a></strong>. We look forward to connecting with you soon!</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-1f5be209 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-ca484dbe\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Blue Staffy News: Join 500+ Readers! </h2></div>\n<div class=\"srfm-form-container srfm-form-container-2029 srfm-bg-color srfm-submit-button-hidden\">\n<div class=\"srfm-single-form srfm-success-box in-page\">\n<div aria-atomic=\"true\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"srfm-success-box-description\" id=\"srfm-success-message-page-2029\" role=\"alert\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<p></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img alt=\"Blue Staffy Puppies Journey | Thank you message from BlueStaffyUK with happy family and Blue Staffy puppy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/thank-you-from-bluestaffyuk-happy-family-blue-staffy.webp\" srcset=\"/images/thank-you-from-bluestaffyuk-happy-family-blue-staffy.webp 500w\" style=\"width:150px\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n";
